    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251126002152\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nenne &amp; Kunne The Twin Ice Tyrants Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"912\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Nenne &amp; Kunne The Twin Ice Tyrants Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/46/Nenne_%26_Kunne_The_Twin_Ice_Tyrants_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251126002152\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>冰霜双暴君</b>\n</p><p>一对美丽战士姐妹，姐姐内内和妹妹库内，她们使用合体技，通过内内的增幅能力强化库内的冰冻之力，使对手陷入混乱。\n\n</p><p>这对美丽战士姐妹要略大于  <a href=\"/wiki/Nanashi\" title=\"Nanashi\">无名</a>.\n</p><p>他们在结合昆妮的「冰冻」神印和妮妮的「增幅」神印开发出能发射强力冰箭的特殊招式后，似乎有点得意忘形。他们的独特说话方式是，妮妮以「~ssu」结尾，昆妮以「~ssho」结尾。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bc78ece7c0f4be597efbcce4414174bf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nenne_stand-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:134px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nenne_stand.png\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:134px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/48/Nenne_stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/134?cb=20260317140723\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nenne stand.png\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_stand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Nenne stand.png (641 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nenne stand.png\" data-image-key=\"Nenne_stand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/48/Nenne_stand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/134?cb=20260317140723\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Screenshot_2024-11-13_010228-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:79px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Screenshot_2024-11-13_010228.jpg\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-11-13 010228.jpg (111 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:79px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/78/Screenshot_2024-11-13_010228.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/79?cb=20260317141244\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-11-13 010228.jpg (111 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 2024-11-13 010228.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Screenshot_2024-11-13_010228.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-11-13 010228.jpg (111 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 2024-11-13 010228.jpg\" da